From: Jerry Hong <jerry.hong@baseten.co>
Date: Tue, 25 Aug 2026 02:00:32 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?REQ-002=20=C2=A74=20logging:=20hint-cause=20+?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20sandbox/episode=20accounting,=20eval=20JSONL=20dump,=20sampl?=
 =?UTF-8?q?e=20transcripts,=20per-step=20scalars?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- StoreStats: hint_ok + hint_drop_{openrouter_error,timeout,empty,parse_fail,other},
  sandbox_fail (+ by-exception Counter), episodes_total, episodes_empty — all in
  as_metrics so they reach train.log + wandb every step.
- hint.py: build_error_hint returns (text, cause); Hints carries cause;
  generate_hint normalizes bare-string test doubles.
- run.py: episode accounting in generate_trajectory (sandbox failures classified
  by exception name and counted, empty transcripts rejected — an all-masked row
  nan-poisons the batch mean), per-cause hint-drop counting, fail-loud startup
  check for srt/rg/bwrap/socat when banking_knowledge is in scope, eval dump wiring.
- logger.py: evaluate/evaluate_pass1 guard per-task episode errors (a banking
  SandboxRuntimeError used to crash baseline mode entirely), score errored tau2
  tasks 0.0, and append per-task rows to eval_dump.jsonl.
- trainer.py: lr + tokens in step metrics, extended per-step log line, and 3
  teacher/student sample transcripts with per-token gap to samples.jsonl.

